# PhishReaper local configuration template.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (which Git ignores) and fill in the value.
# `webapp/app.py` reads the root `.env` file at startup; a value already
# present in the process environment takes precedence over the file.
#
# Optional. Without a key the app runs its local models only and the
# result page reports that threat intelligence is not configured.
#
# The full scanned URL is sent to Google when this is set.
GOOGLE_SAFE_BROWSING_API_KEY=
